<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xilinx EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial said it reduced the earnings estimate on Xilinx Inc to $1.44 per share from $1.68 for fiscal 1997, and to $1.75 from $2 for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- kept the stock rated a short-term hold and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 2-1/2 to 31-1/2 in midmorning exchange trading .</p>
</text>
